/*
 * Pre-compiled VM bytecode — generated by tools/vm_bytecode.py
 *
 * These bytecode programs are embedded in the native library
 * at compile time. The original C functions they replace are
 * never present in the binary.
 *
 * Security: the bytecode includes opaque predicates, dead code,
 * and redundant control flow to resist static analysis.
 */

